<section class="features-section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="section-eyebrow" data-i18n="features.eyebrow">为什么选择 MouseMidModifier</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="features.title">专为 macOS 原生体验精心雕琢</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      <div class="bento-card">
        <h3 class="card-h3" data-i18n="features.f1.title">⚡️ 0 延迟硬件级响应</h3>
        <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="features.f1.desc">基于 macOS CoreGraphics HID 底层事件拦截，按下瞬间即发，无任何多余中转开销。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-card">
        <h3 class="card-h3" data-i18n="features.f2.title">🪶 告别臃肿驱动全家桶</h3>
        <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="features.f2.desc">不再需要常驻几百兆内存的 Logitech G HUB 或 Options+，应用体积不到 5MB，内存占用仅 10MB。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-card">
        <h3 class="card-h3" data-i18n="features.f3.title">⌨️ 全键盘任意键映射</h3>
        <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="features.f3.desc">支持所有标准字母、数字、功能键与特殊符号，精准识别与区分左右 Control、Option、Command 等修饰键。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-card">
        <h3 class="card-h3" data-i18n="features.f4.title">✨ 极简菜单栏常驻</h3>
        <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="features.f4.desc">精美 macOS 拟真弹窗，无 Dock 栏多余图标打扰，支持开机静默自启动与即时修改测试。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
